    "F is conservative on ℝ³ exactly when its curl is 0. Match P_y with Q_x (and the pairs involving z) and see what that forces on a and b; then integrate to find f.", { formula: "\\nabla\\times\\mathbf F=\\mathbf 0\\iff P_y=Q_x,\\ P_z=R_x,\\ Q_z=R_y" });
};

